#13001
Inn of the Drinking Whale~
  Your first recollections concerning the costal city of Ys will always be of
the many groggy awakenings here at the Inn of the Drinking Whale, named not so
much as for any sea faring behemoth, as for it's patrons, who seemingly drink
like whales.  Picking your throbbing head off the table, you force your eyes
to focus upon what looks like a MAP carved on it's wooden surface.  The stout
door to the south leads to the bazaar and there is a small side door in the
east wall leading to the wharf.  You can go up to rent a room for the night,
or stay here and order another round...
~
