#13008
The Arborium~
   Among the flora of the city's finest arborium are small shrines to the
gods of Ys.  Taranis, of course, is chiefly represented, but so too are Loth
the Silver Handed, and Belenos, the warrior.  A narrow bridge crosses the
plaza from here, to another hilltop.
