#13017
Sea Scape on the Low Road~
   As you stroll through the sea of elbows and shoves, you pause to gaze down
from your vantage point on the hill, over the black-grey citywall, to a 
beautiful site.  Be it day or night, the waters of the Avillion Channel seem
to shimmer in the straylight.  Too bad the denizens of Ys are too immersed
in their own schemes to notice.
