#13095
Southgate~
  You stand before the great citygate of Ys, carved from ancient black stone
and pitted from many a cast spear and arrow.  Though battered, they still hold
strong, rising above the squalor that is southern Ys.  Exits lead out in all directions, but a stench to the west heralds the city's dump.
~
