#13102
The Cave Mouth~
   You are inside the mouth of a comfortably large cave, set into the hill, 
just below the citywall of Ys.  You figure this would make nice shelter for
rogues, although the stench of the dump to the north, and a weaker though
more menacing smell from the east, make this bit of real estate unappealing.
To the south you see the barren, rocky countryside of the Bretton Peninsula.
~
