#13109
Outside the Southgate~
  The barren countryside that composes the small penninsula upon which the
city of Ys is built, stretches off before you, generally southeast.  The great
walls of Ys surround the pennisula's northwestern end, with its main gate 
to your north.  The long, dusty road to Rennes begins here and heads south.
~
