#13110
On Craggy Ground~
  You are standing upon the craggy ground on the outside of a great, dark,
and pitted citywall.  The spray of surf can be heard over the cliff to the
west.  To the east you spy a large gate set in the south of the citywall, and
a road leading away from it, heading south.  Amid the rubble to your north,
you see a cave open, just beneath the heavy towered wall.
~
