#13112
Cobbled Street ~
   You are on a cobbled street set high upon Merchant's Hill.  From here 
you have a nice view over the citywall of the shimmering sea. Unlike most of
the city, this throughfare is clean and well lit by brass lanterns hung
upon posts.  Wealth hath is privilages.  The street continues back east and
ends in a nice cul de sac serves as entry to a small manor to the west
.~
