#13121
Garrison Headquarters~
  You are on the ground floor of a squat round tower made of ancient blacken
stone, now pitted with age, though still strong.  Wooden desks and chairs line
the walls with parchments bearing lists of names.  Shackes, chains and irons
rest upon pegs in the walls.  A staircase curving along the south wall leads
up and a wooden trapdoor, grated for ventilation, is set into the floor.
